      "question": "A series is given with one term missing. Select the correct alternative from the given ones that will complete the series. GK15, ?, KG139, ME418, OC1255",
      "questionHtml": "<p>A series is given with one term missing. Select the correct alternative from the given ones that will complete the series.</p>\n\n<p>GK15, ?, KG139, ME418, OC1255</p>\n",
