          "text": "HI44",
          "html": "HI44"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>According to the alphabetical positions of the letters,</p>\n\n<p>Logic for the first term: Letter&#39;s position&nbsp; is <strong>increased by 2&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>Logic for the Second&nbsp;term:&nbsp;Letter&#39;s position&nbsp; is <strong>decreased by 2&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p>Logic for Third&nbsp;term:&nbsp;<strong>Next number =&nbsp;Number&nbsp;&times; 3 + 1&nbsp;</strong></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage3789.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>&lsquo;II46&rsquo;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
